# kk: Support native VK_EXT_image_view_min_lod on M6+
# https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/45110 state=merged
# ### What does this MR do and why?

```
kk: Support native VK_EXT_image_view_min_lod on M6+

M6 introduces support for specifying a minLOD on a texture view,
so we can support and advertise this extension without emulation.
```
